Office work is finished.
Rohan, Priya, and I leave the office.
We want to go to my home.
Outside, there is still heavy rain.
Rohan looks at his mobile.
He says, "Today the buses are running very late."
"Therefore, we will go by the metro."
I agree, and we go to the metro station.
Inside, I buy three tickets from the counter.
Many months ago, I learned to use the metro.
Now, I have understood all the routes perfectly.
Priya says, "It is very crowded here."
"But we are safe from the rain."
Our metro train arrives quickly.
We board the train and sit together.
The metro runs fast.
I look at my friends and feel happy.
In January, I arrived here alone.
Today for my birthday, I have brought them home.
